---
name: reminders
description: The next few pending reminders. Only rendered when there are some.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  reminders:
    kind: array
    description: "one line per reminder, \"2026-09-23 18:00 — Call mum\""
    example:
      - "2026-10-01 18:00 — Call mum"
---
Upcoming reminders (times in the user's zone):
{{#reminders}}
- {{.}}
{{/reminders}}
